!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
# The renderer library and its dependencies, installed by vsce from the production tree
# (ADR 0010). Only files provably unused at runtime are left out (type declarations, source
# maps); the packaged-VSIX host test is the guard. vsce lets any negation win over any
# ignore, so the trim is written into the negation itself.
!node_modules/**/!(*.d.ts|*.map)
